                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "this game was interesting to say the least.\n\ni decided to play this game because of Coryxkenshin (aka my goat.) then i decided to give it a try.\n\nwhat i liked about the game:\n\ni think it has a lot more love put into it vs other yandere games. for instance, there's others that take copy paste yandere simulator models and paste them into unity and make a shitty yandere simulator rip off. this game doesn't do that. it has voice actors, achievements, and a full complete story. i also think the game is a little bit goofy.\n\nwhat i disliked about the game:\n\nthe game doesn't take that long to finish. even trying to get all of the achievements is light work. and ofc that should be expected for an old game like this. but it could've been slightly longer?, maybe around 3-4 hours worth of story content?.\n\noverall opinion:\n\nits a goofy game. if you enjoy goofy yandere simulator rip-offs or spin-offs, then id suggest trying it out. but if you were looking for a more mature and serious experience, then this game isn't for you.",
